  "body": "## What changed\n\nAdd plain-English labels and descriptive hover tooltips to all 12 icon controls in the main viewport bottom bar (#2914):\n- Add `label(kind: Nav) -> &'static str` for consistent accessible button names: `Frame all`, `Isometric view`, `Display mode`, `Show all toolpaths`, `World axes`, `Pick through`, `Move mode`, `Rotate mode`, `Projection`, `Orbit tool`, `Pan tool`, `Zoom tool`.\n- Add `tooltip(kind: Nav, state: &State) -> String` to show concise descriptions that reflect dynamic toggle states (wireframe on/off, toolpaths on/off, world axes on/off, pick-through on/off, move handles on/off, rotate rings on/off, perspective/orthographic projection, and active nav drag latch).\n- Attach `ui.interact` with `Sense::hover()`, `widget_info`, and `on_hover_text(tip)` inside `viewport_bar::draw`, suppressed while a viewport drag is active.\n\n## Readings and Pinning Tests\n\n- `egui_app::viewport_bar::tests::nav_buttons_have_distinct_labels_and_descriptive_tooltips`: asserts each of the 12 controls has a non-empty label and tooltip, and that state changes reflect in the tooltip output.\n- `egui_app::viewport_bar::tests::nav_buttons_attach_tooltips_on_hover`: asserts all 12 controls expose matching accessibility nodes and paint their hover tooltips when hovered in an egui harness.\n- Verified all 23 viewport tests in `camcraft-ui` pass.\n- Verified clean `coderabbit review --agent --base upstream/main` (0 findings).\n\n## What was not exercised\n\n- Full GPU hardware rendering pipeline (covered by GPU test suites in CI).\n\nChangelog: UI: add hover tooltips and accessibility labels to the 12 main viewport controls\n\nFixes #2914\n",
